      <value>Enter date: The effective date of the policy.  The date that the terms and conditions of the policy commence.  (MM/DD/YYYY) As used here, the date on which the terms and conditions of the policy will commence.  For assigned risk business being submitted with the ACORD 133 use the effective date on that form, following state mandated rules.</value>
