    <help sid="HelpPolicy_ExpirationDate_A">
      <value>Enter date: The date on which the terms and conditions of the policy will expire.  (MM/DD/YYYY) As used here, the date on which the terms and conditions of the policy will expire.

The normal policy period (effective date to expiration date) is one year. However, a policy may be issued for any length of time up to a maximum of three years. Certain rules and endorsements must be used if the policy is written for more than one year. It may be necessary to use Effective and Expiration Dates that do not indicate a one year term, to concur with other policies.</value>
    </help>
