    <help sid="HelpPolicy_ParticipatingIndicator_A">
      <value>Check the box (if applicable): Indicates the policy is a participating policy.  A Participating policy may result in reduced premiums through the payment of policyholder dividends declared by the insurer. Some policyholder dividends are based on actual experience of the applicant. If such a program is available through the company in the covered state, indicate whether the policy is to be on a Participating or Non-Participating basis. Check with your company on the availability of plans. </value>
    </help>
